1
00:00:00,785 --> 00:00:02,915
(Penny:)Based on real events.

2
00:00:04,088 --> 00:00:06,988
(Raj:)Anyway, I was hoping
I could, uh, pick your brains a little.

3
00:00:07,158 --> 00:00:10,888
(Raj:)I'm supposed to take Lucy out Friday
and I need a killer first date.

4
00:00:11,429 --> 00:00:14,419
(Amy:)Evolutionary biology
says that women are attracted to a man...

5
00:00:14,599 --> 00:00:19,059
...who is steady in the face of danger,
so I recommend an unsafe environment.

6
00:00:20,672 --> 00:00:24,002
A seedy bar
on the wrong side of the tracks...

7
00:00:24,175 --> 00:00:26,905
...a picnic near a lunatic asylum...

8
00:00:27,612 --> 00:00:30,272
...a wine-tasting on skid row.

9
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:37,050
(Raj:)Lucy has some, uh, social anxiety issues,
we could start with something simpler.

10
00:00:37,555 --> 00:00:39,315
(Bernadette:)Why don't you take her to Disneyland?

11
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:42,820
(Bernadette:)You go on Space Mountain,
you're in the dark, she's holding onto you.

12
00:00:42,994 --> 00:00:45,084
(Penny:)That ride is shorter than you think...

13
00:00:45,263 --> 00:00:49,253
(Penny:)...and they take a picture of you at the end,
so make sure you got your clothes on.

14
00:00:51,502 --> 00:00:53,662
It's ajoke.

15
00:00:54,472 --> 00:00:56,562
(Penny:)Based on real events.

16
00:00:57,308 --> 00:00:58,638
(Raj:)Disneyland? I don't know.

17
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,800
(Raj:)With all the crowds
and the weird characters walking around...

